on>Printing materials</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://hebbkx1anhila5yf.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sk-tshirt-fcR64JdEAx3ZqloWpTFpFT9et85eg3.png" alt="Black SK Graphics branded t shirt"><figcaption>Branded t shirts</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://hebbkx1anhila5yf.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sk-mugs-2HB72ue3n80SxYgrHiwuTYaDCWiMGr.png" alt="White SK Graphics mug on a kitchen table"><figcaption>Custom mugs</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://hebbkx1anhila5yf.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sk-roll-up-banner-AyCbZEvDN7EuKWPAt0bcAryP82DF2m.png" alt="SK Graphics roll up banner at a business expo"><figcaption>Roll up banners</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://hebbkx1anhila5yf.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sk-stickers-GVmHHc35TMeTWlBJNduGhkm8OOIg6v.png" alt="SK Graphics sticker sheet with colorful logos"><figcaption>Custom stickers</figcaption></figure></div><button class="btn btn-accent" id="checkoutBtn" style="width:100%;margin-top:18px"><i class="fa-solid fa-bag-shopping"></i> Open checkout</button></div>
